// Suppressor — a threaded muzzle can that muffles the shot: fits the Silenced tag so the
// weapon's fire propagates neither SUPPRESSION nor REACTION/REVEAL (both producer gates read
// the tag). Data-driven attachment ITEM. No payload — the tag carries its own meaning.
// Referenced by a weapon BY KEY (`suppressor`) in its `attachments:` list; applied post-spawn.
(
    display_name: "Suppressor",
    slot: Muzzle,  // threads onto the muzzle — fits only a weapon declaring a Muzzle slot
    effects: [
        Silence,  // the shot propagates neither suppression nor reaction/reveal
    ],
)
